    <briefdescription>
<para>This pass transforms loops that contain a conditional branch with induction variable. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>For example, it transforms left code to right code: <verbatim>                         newbound = min(n, c)
</verbatim> while (iv &lt; n) { while(iv &lt; newbound) { A A if (iv &lt; c) B B C C } if (iv != n) { while (iv &lt; n) { A C } } </para>
    </detaileddescription>
